{"resource":"lines/special-ed-transp-system","about":"One budget line, every year and stage a document states it.","count":8,"caveats":["A STAGE IS NOT A PERIOD. There is no join between this table and `ledger_snapshot` and nothing should invent one.","An \"actual\" here is a RESTATEMENT: a prior year re-presented by the people who spent it, inside the argument for the next budget. It is not a ledger figure.","These lines do NOT sum back to the district totals -- between 0.1% and 1.6% out. Never apportion a total across them.","`documents_disagree` marks a figure two documents state differently. The documents disagree with themselves by up to 1.5%, which is larger than most variances anybody wants to measure.","FY2021 is unusable: 117 of 120 lines print the budget under an \"actual\" heading. Exclude it."],"provenance":{"documents":[{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget/text/fy18-non-personnel-supt-recommended-budget-revised-6-6-17.txt","path":"sources/district-budget/text/fy18-non-personnel-supt-recommended-budget-revised-6-6-17.txt","basis":"budget","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":"75207f164c59ec20ed6e8007059c245f4a9cf73d74dc9bc8b394298362d76a6b","cited_as":"sources/district-budget/text/fy18-non-personnel-supt-recommended-budget-revised-6-6-17.txt"},{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget/text/fy19-supt-proposed-expense-budget.txt","path":"sources/district-budget/text/fy19-supt-proposed-expense-budget.txt","basis":"both","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":"7f2ddbba74013a69863a7a92dd2fc143b2c6368ac5c9556a6e0bbac65254e2e3","cited_as":"sources/district-budget/text/fy19-supt-proposed-expense-budget.txt"}],"count":2},"rows":[{"line_key":"special ed transp system","label":"Special Education Transp - System","fy":2014,"stage":"actual","value":445034.0,"documents_disagree":0,"doc_id":"sources/district-budget/text/fy19-supt-proposed-expense-budget.txt"},{"line_key":"special ed transp system","label":"Special Education Transp - System","fy":2015,"stage":"actual","value":48